                0.376,
                0.136
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "1、【2024 华南理工大学】",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.146,
                0.346,
                0.163
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "已知某系统的输入为：",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.692,
                0.078,
                0.925,
                0.178
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\begin{array}{r l} {\\frac {\\sin (\\frac {\\pi}{2} n)}{\\pi n}} & {= \\frac {1}{2} \\cdot \\frac {\\sin (\\frac {\\pi}{2} n)}{\\frac {\\pi}{2} n}} \\\\ & {= \\frac {1}{2} \\operatorname{Sal} (\\frac {\\pi}{2} n)} \\end{array}\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.374,
                0.17,
                0.624,
                0.216
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\nx [ n ] = \\frac {s i n (\\frac {\\pi}{2} n) - s i n (\\frac {\\pi}{8} n)}{\\pi n}\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.155,
                0.219,
                0.452,
                0.238
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "(1) 求输入的傅里叶变换 \\( X(e^{j\\omega}) \\) ;",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.696,
                0.184,
                1.0,
                0.246
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\frac {\\sin (\\frac {\\pi}{8} n)}{\\pi n} = \\frac {1}{8} \\frac {\\sin (\\frac {\\pi}{8} n)}{\\frac {\\pi}{8} n} = \\frac {1}{8} \\sin (\\frac {\\pi}{8} n)\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.153,
                0.244,
                0.854,
                0.267
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "(2) \\(x[n]\\) 经过以下系统，其中 \\(H(e^{j\\omega})\\) 为截止频率为 \\(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\)，幅值为1的理想低通滤波",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.275,
                0.475,
                0.294
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "器，求其输出信号 \\( y[n] \\) 的频谱 \\( Y(e^{j\\omega}) \\) 。",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.655,
                0.266,
                0.965,
                0.309
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\mathrm{即} x (n) = \\frac {1}{2} S a (\\frac {\\pi}{2} n) - \\frac {1}{8} S a (\\frac {\\pi}{8} n)\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "image",
            "bbox": [
                0.252,
                0.299,
                0.986,
                0.462
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": null
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.124,
                0.445,
                0.544,
                0.622
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\begin{array}{r l} h (n) & = \\left\\{\\sqrt {n} \\cdot (- 1) ^ {n} \\right] * h _ {\\varphi} (n) \\\\ & = \\left[ \\sqrt {n} * h _ {\\varphi} (n) \\right] (- 1) ^ {n} + h _ {\\varphi} (n) \\\\ & = h _ {\\varphi} (n) (- 1) ^ {n} + h _ {\\varphi} (n) \\end{array}\\tag{2}"
        },
