        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.156,
                0.432,
                0.522,
                0.452
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "(2) 求系统函数 \\(H(z)\\), 并画出零极点图;",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.891,
                0.417,
                0.997,
                0.454
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "∵|2|＜4梯\n↓足",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.156,
                0.459,
                0.46,
                0.479
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "(3) 求该系统所表示的差分方程;",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.482,
